<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Frostball</h1>
<p>Sphere: Frost Sphere
Spell Tier: 2
Class: Sorcerer (guild level 19)
Mana: 24
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast frostball &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast frostball</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>The caster's hand shakes with the words 'Bolat snellok', and a small ball 
of frozen air forms and is hurled at the target. The better your magic and 
your frost sphere, the more it chills. Cold cares little for armour: it 
bites nearly as hard through plate as through clothes. A shield can block 
it.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It can be cast while fighting, 
and no free hands are needed. It is also found on wands, staffs and 
scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Iceball</a>
